    "prompt": "\n      请根据以下漏洞信息、搜索结果和漏洞利用代码，生成一份详细的漏洞分析报告，包含有效性分析、投毒风险分析、利用方式、代码分析等内容。请注意以下几点：\n\n    **信息来源：**\n\n    *   **漏洞库信息：**\n        ```\n        {\"cve_id\": \"CVE-2026-96778\", \"sources\": [\"NVD\", \"OSCS\"], \"descriptions\": [\"Pillow is a Python imaging library. From 9.4.0 until 13.0.0, ImagingJpegEncode() in src/libImaging/JpegEncode.c can call jpeg_write_marker() for a JPEG COM comment when an ICC profile has exactly filled the 65536-byte encoder buffer. libjpeg writes one byte before checking the exhausted free_in_buffer counter, which then wraps and permits the attacker-controlled comment and subsequent compressed image data to overwrite adjacent heap memory. Re-saving an untrusted image as JPEG while preserving its ICC profile and forwarded comment can crash the process and may enable code execution in suitable runtime and heap layouts. This issue is fixed in version 13.0.0.\", \"\\u6807\\u9898: Pillow JPEG\\u5806\\u6ea2\\u51fa\\u6f0f\\u6d1e\"], \"published_date\": \"2026-10-21T21:20:33.093\", \"last_modified_date\": \"2026-10-28T02:17:08.253\", \"cvss_score\": 8.8, \"severity\": \"HIGH\", \"references\": [\"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"g\", \"i\", \"t\", \"h\", \"u\", \"b\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"p\", \"y\", \"t\", \"h\", \"o\", \"n\", \"-\", \"p\", \"i\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\", \"w\", \"/\", \"P\", \"i\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\", \"w\", \"/\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"m\", \"i\", \"t\", \"/\", \"0\", \"2\", \"5\", \"6\", \"1\", \"b\", \"8\", \"d\", \"c\", \"6\", \"1\", \"1\", \"7\", \"d\", \"5\", \"6\", \"7\", \"0\", \"d\", \"4\", \"b\", \"4\", \"6\", \"9\", \"f\", \"e\", \"c\", \"d\", \"d\", \"0\", \"2\", \"c\", \"7\", \"0\", \"8\", \"5\", \"4\", \"f\", \"9\", \"b\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"g\", \"i\", \"t\", \"h\", \"u\", \"b\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"p\", \"y\", \"t\", \"h\", \"o\", \"n\", \"-\", \"p\", \"i\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\", \"w\", \"/\", \"P\", \"i\",